  DisplayName: Finadar Leshy
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Prerequisites Leshy ancestry You are a leshy from Finadar Forest,
    originally created under the corruption of a cyclopean monolith. Though the Pathfinder
    Society managed to sever the monolith's connection, freeing the forest and your
    people from its influence, you retain a trace, unnerving connection to the Abyss.
    Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Charisma , and one
    is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Intimidation skill and the Abyssal
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Intimidating Glare]
    skill feat.
  SourceTitle: 'Pathfinder Society Scenario #1-15: The Blooming Catastrophe'
